# D3-TH-002: Chain length can change room-temperature phase behaviour
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 dodecane 5g @ 10C
add v2 hexadecane 5g @ 10C
measure v1 melting_point
measure v2 melting_point
look v1
look v2
heat v1 0.3kJ
heat v2 0.3kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
look v1
look v2
inspect
